Validation update 2026-10-17: review reconciliation confirmed T3 commit 635cc3f6 contains the five caller-bound tools and lifecycle integration. Focused c2c guard validation passed after code generation: OpenCode 42 passed/1 pre-existing skip; c2c_mcp_disabled 8/8; c2c_hook_claude 20/20. Focused T3 Node 24.13.1 validation initially exposed a real SQLite boolean-parameter regression in mailbox pagination; fixed in T3 commit 65adc167 by binding numeric predicates. The full focused T3 suite now passes 10 files/114 tests. T004 live matrix remains outstanding; do not close T003/T004 or claim end-to-end delivery until isolated T3/Codex receipts exist.

